{"id":1147,"level":83,"name":"Захист від прохідних пішаків","group":"Практика","format":27,"description":"<p>You already know that a passed pawn can be very dangerous. You obviously want to defend against this threat.<br /><br />Basic defense plans against passed pawns are:</p>  <ul>  <li>block a passed pawn by occupying its promotion square</li>  <li>stop a passed pawn by controlling its promoting square</li>  <li>counterattacks</li>  <li>stalemate tricks</li>  </ul>  <p>It may be necessary to sacrifice material in order to prevent a pawn&rsquo;s promotion. If you&rsquo;re up in material, this&nbsp;is not necessarily fatal.<br /><br /><strong>What do you have to do?</strong><br />Defend against the threat of passed pawns.</p>","assignment":"","stickerID":0,"examples":[{"fen":"6k1/1p1P2pp/p3q1b1/8/P3p3/7P/1PP3P1/3R2K1 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yd7][%cal Yd7d8]} 1... Qb6+ 2. Kh1 Qd8 1-0","text":"<p>Спершу зробивши розумний шах, чорні можуть заблокувати пішака, який пройшов білі, ферзем.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"8/1b4P1/p2k4/Pp1p4/1P6/2K5/8/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Gb7,Yg7][%cal Yg7g8]} 1... d4+ 2. Kxd4 Bd5 3. g8=Q Bxg8 1-0","text":"<p>У цьому прикладі білі звільняють місце для слона, спочатку жертвуючи пішака. Потім слон може покрити поле перетворення.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"8/8/3k1r2/5p1p/3K1P1P/R5P1/3p4/2r3R1 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Yd2d1]} 1. Ra1 Rxa1 2. Rxa1 1-0","text":"<p>Білі тури чудово працюють разом на нижньому резервуарі та стримують сильного пішака.</p>","format":27},{"fen":"8/1b6/4Qp1k/8/6p1/3q2P1/1p5K/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yb2,Yh2][%cal Yb2b1]} 1. Qe3+ $1 (1. Qxf6+?   Qg6 2. Qh8+ Qh7 3. Qf6+ Kh5 4. Qxb2 Kg5+ 5. Kg1 Qh1+ 6. Kf2 Qg2+ 7. Ke3 Qxb2) 1... Qxe3 {[%csl Gh2]} 1-0","text":"<p>Цього разу неможливо зупинити пішака. Тим не менш, білі можуть зберегти нічию за допомогою красивого патового трюку!</p>","format":27},{"fen":"r7/5pkp/3p2p1/1RbPp3/4B2P/1R3PP1/p3P3/4K3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%cal Ya2a1]} 1. Rb1 a1=Q 2. Rxa1 Rxa1+ 1-0","text":"<p>Коли пішак підвищується, пішак часто перетворюється на ферзя. Іноді розумно пожертвувати турою замість пішака. Ось такий випадок!</p>","format":27}],"puzzles":[{"id":50029,"fen":"8/8/5k2/1p3P2/1P4PP/4K3/4b3/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yf5,Yg4,Yh4][%cal Gg4g8,Gh4h8,Gf5f8]} 1... Bxg4 {[%csl Rf5,Rh4]} (1... Bc4?  ) 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45799,"fen":"8/1b4P1/p2k4/Pp1p4/1P6/2K5/8/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... d4+ 2. Kxd4 Bd5 3. g8=Q Bxg8 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":39617,"fen":"8/2p3p1/1p2P1k1/p2p4/5n2/2P1K3/P6P/4R3 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... Ng2+ (1... Nxe6?   2. Rd1 +/=) 2. Kf2 Nxe1 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49389,"fen":"6k1/1p5p/p1PP4/8/8/P6P/5rBK/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc6,Yd6][%cal Gd6d8]} 1... bxc6 2. d7 Rd2 -+ (2... Rf8?  ) 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49391,"fen":"8/7p/1K1k4/P7/8/7r/8/5B2 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya5][%cal Ga5a8]} 1... Rb3+ {[%csl Ra5][%cal Gh7h1]} (1... Ra3?  ) 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":49312,"fen":"8/8/5k2/2pPp3/4Pp1p/p1K2P1P/8/8 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Ya3][%cal Ga3a1]} 1. Kb3 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":48786,"fen":"8/8/2Pr4/3P4/7p/8/2k4K/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc6][%cal Gc6c8]} 1... Rxd5 2. c7 Rc5 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":43442,"fen":"k7/6P1/r7/1K6/8/8/8/8 b - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yg7]} 1... Rg6 0-1","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":50746,"fen":"6k1/8/8/2n5/5P2/6P1/P1p1R1K1/1r2B3 w - - 0 1","pgn":"{[%csl Yc2][%cal Gc2c1]} 1. Rxc2 Rxe1 2. Rxc5 1-0","format":27,"texts":[],"text":"","isMulti":0,"multiThemes":[]},{"id":45825,"fen":"1r6/1R1P1pk1/4pnp1/2p4p/Pp6/1P4P1/3R1PKP/1b6 b - - 0 1","pgn":"1... Be4+ (1... Rxb7?   2. d8=Q) (1... Rd8 2. f3 =) 2. f3 Bxb7 3. d8=Q Rxd8 4. Rxd8 0-1","forma